      "title": "Pine Labs Appoints Shalini Pillai as Chief Marketing Officer",
      "body": "Pine Labs, announced the appointment of industry veteran Shalini Pillai as its new Chief Marketing Officer (CMO). In this role, Shalini will lead global marketing strategy, product marketing, marcom, and brand positioning for Pine Labs. Prior to joining Pine Labs, Shalini was the Marketing Director - India and South Asia at Microsoft. A decade-plus veteran of Google and Microsoft and a former entrepreneur, she has a proven track record of scaling high-impact portfolios across consumer apps, digital payments, and enterprise ecosystems. Her nearly two decades of experience and expertise in bridging deep-tech innovation with aggressive market acquisition will be pivotal as she spearheads Pine Labs' marketing and growth strategy across its global footprint. The appointment comes at a time when",
